                                        <td class="class11">
                                                        <b> Adequate </b>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
                                                                    <tr>
                                        <td class="class11">
                                            <span style="font-size:12px"><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman'"><span style="color:black">The liquidity profile of Best Finance Corporation Limited (BFCL) remains adequate, supported by a positive asset-liability cumulative mismatch. As per the ALM statement dated March 31, 2026, BFCL’s repayment obligations (total outflows) during FY2026-27 are expected to be Rs. 703.38 Cr., against total receivables (inflows) of around Rs. 1195.43 Cr. over the same period, resulting in an expected positive mismatch of Rs. 492.05 Cr. The company also maintained cash and bank balances of around Rs. 25 Cr. as on March 31, 2026 (Prov.).&nbsp;BFCL has established relationships with more than 25 lenders including commercial banks, small finance banks, NBFCs and NCD investors.</span></span></span>
                                        </td>
                                    </tr>
